  "decision_conditions": [
    "FLAT ROOF NOT USED AS AMENITY SPACE (COMPLIANCE): The second floor ‘Juliet balcony’ shall be installed in accordance with the approved drawings and the door opening shall not be used as a means of access to the flat roof of the rear outrigger. The flat roof area as shown on approved drawings 08/12 REV D (PROPOSED FLOOR PLANS), 09/12 (PROPOSED FLOOR PLAN) and 11/12 REV D (PROPOSED ELEVATIONS) shall not be used as an amenity or sitting out space of any kind whatsoever and shall not be used other than for essential maintenance, repair, or escape in case of emergency.  \r\n\r\nREASON: To prevent the undue overlooking of neighbouring habitable room windows."
